  "reviewer_note": "The CAVR figure is a minimum (102,800, about 18,600 killed or disappeared and about 84,200 from hunger and illness), per HRDAG, which worked with the commission; HRDAG also describes an upper-bound 183,000 for hunger and illness deaths. Other pages quote 200,000+; not used. Dili is where the IPS witness saw the attack, not necessarily the only landing.",
